<title>UK: Manchester United down on European defeat.</title>
<headline>Manchester United down on European defeat.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Manchester United Plc dropped early on Thursday after the soccer club was defeated at home in last night's European Champions League clash with Italian club Juventus.</p>
<p>The stock was down 16-1/2p at 545 by 9824 GMT.</p>
<p>Last night's defeat makes it more difficult for United, which dropped to third position in the Champions League qualifying groups, to go through to the next stage of the lucrative competition.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
